# Deny everything, allow only what the Dockerfile actually copies — the
# same discipline as the Vera repo's own .dockerignore. `.gitignore` does
# not apply to a build context, so this is the thing that actually keeps
# secrets and scratch files out of the image.
*

!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!src

# Never ship any .env* even though the rule above allows the whole tree
# back in — order matters, last match wins, and a stray file like
# `.env,` must not get pulled in by accident either.
.env*
**/.env*
